{
    "reasoner_response": "Recommend the customer start with their selling dealer, Rocky Mountain Chevrolet, who can be reached at 3035550190, as they are familiar with the contract and can work directly with Assurant. Explain that the repair facility (not the customer) must contact Assurant to initiate and authorize the claim process before repairs begin. Guide the customer through these steps: 1) Take the vehicle to a repair facility (selling dealer preferred, or any repair location found on vehicle care plan dot com), 2) The repair facility contacts Assurant to get the claim authorized, 3) Assurant reviews and authorizes covered repairs. If the customer needs help locating a repair facility, let them know they can find one online at vehicle care plan dot com. Ask if there is anything else they need help with.",
    "communication_rules": [
        "- If the customer tried to change the topic while you are waiting for Supervisor instructions, before following any Reasoner's instructions, ask the customer whether they want to switch to the new topic or continue with the current one.",
        "- If any previous requests were prevented from execution, they can now be re-evaluated and executed if appropriate. Make a new function/tool request to do so."
    ]
}
